Hello all,

PolicyCenter will be upgraded from 11.2 to 11.4 on Saturday, September 26.

Outage window: 6:00 a.m. to 2:00 p.m. Central. The agent portal and the policyholder portal will show a maintenance page during this window. ClaimsDesk is NOT affected.

What changes for users:
  * New search bar in the header (searches policies, accounts and agents).
  * Rating Factors comparison screen now shows dollar impact per factor.
  * Document preview no longer requires a download.

Batch jobs: the renewal batch for September 26 will run at 4:00 p.m. instead of 1:00 a.m. No renewal dates change.

Year end release freeze: no template or batch configuration changes will be deployed between November 20 and January 4. Changes needed for January 1 must be in UAT by November 6.

If you see problems after the upgrade, open a ticket in ServicePoint with category "PolicyCenter 11.4".

Thanks,
Release Management
